## Layout
- `src/` production code · `tests/` mirrors `src/` · `docs/` design docs
- `.claude/` agent harness — see `.claude/skills/repo-conventions/` for details

## Workflow
- One chat per task. For parallel work: `git worktree add ../{{ project_name }}-<feature> -b feat/<feature>`.
- `/plan` before non-trivial work; skip if you can describe the diff in one sentence.
- Run `/review` before `/commit`. Run `/techdebt` at end of session.
- Conventional Commits, one logical change per commit.

## Boundaries
**Always**: tests pass before declaring done; new code paths get tests; follow existing patterns.
**Ask first**: schema migrations, new dependencies, CI/infra changes.
**Never**: commit secrets or `.env*`; force-push to `main`; bypass hooks; modify `vendor/` or generated files.

